# Operational memory and host scripts — NEVER commit, this repo is public.
#
# These record the live deployment: the VPS address, Docker subnets, volume
# names, the Telegram group ID, credential-rotation status, and scripts that
# configure access to all of it. Publishing any of it is not recoverable —
# history and clones keep it after a delete. Kept on disk, out of git.
/ops/
/docs/HANDOFF.md
/docs/session-notes/
/docs/research-landscape.md
/docs/SPEC-topic-binding.md

# Same class of file under any name or location, so a copy, a rename or a new
# project folder is ignored by default rather than by someone remembering.
HANDOFF*.md
handoff.md
handoff.history.md
handoff.offset
**/handoffs/
**/.claude/handoffs/
session-notes/
session-20*.md
*.session.md
